Miscellaneous qcom support bits, from the squashed liuqin downstream
patch.

Adjustments for v7.2.5:
- drivers/of/platform.c hunk dropped: v7.2.5 upstream already walks only
  the children of /reserved-memory instead of for_each_matching_node(),
  which is exactly the fix the downstream patch carried.
- drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-common.h and phy-qcom-qmp-pcie.c
  hunks dropped: v7.2.5 no longer has the debug printk the downstream
  patch rewrote (qmp_configure_lane() now logs without the address).
- drivers/soc/qcom/ubwc_config.c: qcom,cape entry added manually;
  v7.2.5 already maps qcom,sm8450/sm8475 to sm8350_data.
- drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_pas.c, drivers/tty/serial
  earlycon-simplefb: applied cleanly, no changes.

